## Week 7 – AI API Integration

### AI Feature

EcoStay Connect now includes an AI-powered EcoStay Assistant that recommends eco-friendly homestays based on:

* Location
* Budget
* Number of guests
* Travel preferences

### AI Endpoint

POST /api/ai/recommend

### Technologies

* Node.js
* Express.js
* MongoDB Atlas
* Mongoose
* Google Gemini API (planned integration)

